cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use TCL4, please cite Chen et al., Benchmarking TCL4 (2025).
  If you use TCL6, please cite both that paper and Chen, Chen, and Davidovic,
  Fast Evaluation of the Sixth-Order Time-Convolutionless Master-Equation
  Generator and Beyond (2026). Full references are listed in README.md.
type: software
title: "FastTCL: standalone TCL2, TCL4, and fast TCL6 master equations"
